== Links == {{Links}}
== Welcome to {{SITENAME}}! ==
Welcome to the Upgradex Wiki! This wiki is dedicated to the Roblox game [https://www.roblox.com/games/128718594394791/Upgradex Upgradex], developed by [https://www.roblox.com/communities/32953855/orthogon-studios#!/about orthogon studios]. The studio is owned by [https://www.roblox.com/users/2359603031/profile ASAP], the former owner of ''Everything Upgrade Tree''. Upgradex is an incremental game, more specifically an upgrade tree that was released on July 5th of 2026.
== Relevant Pages == * [[Main Baseplate]] * [[Research Baseplate]] * [[Nowhere]] * [[Donation Baseplate]] * [[Bonus Baseplate]]

