== Features ==
=== The Core ===

[[File:TheCore.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[The Core]]''
{{Energy|Core|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked alongside {{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} {{Energy}} after the player purchases Upgrade {{Research|<nowiki>#CR</nowiki>|symbol=no}} in the Research Baseplate.

=== Computer ===

[[File:Computer.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Computer]]''
The Computer is a feature unlocked by {{Research|<nowiki>#3RB</nowiki>|symbol=no}} that allows the player play various minigames inside it.

=== AutoBuy Settings ===

[[File:AutoBuy Settings.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Autobuy Settings]]''
