|-
| #2fh || Wholesale || {{Tag|Upgrade|Alpha}}{{Tag|Upgrade|Fish}} || 1 || {{Upgradecost|#2fh}} || Unlock <span style="color:#ffff96;">Market</span>🧺<br>Higher level give you access to more items
|-
| #3fh || Discoveries || {{Tag|Upgrade|Alpha}}{{Tag|Upgrade|Fish}} || 1 || {{Upgradecost|#3fh}} || Unlock <span style="color:#8cb4ff;">Entries</span><br>Sell fish for Fish Points {{Fish}}
|-
| #4fh || Sparkle up || {{Tag|Upgrade|Alpha}}{{Tag|Upgrade|Fish}} || 1 || {{Upgradecost|#4fh}} || Unlock <span style="color:#9666ff;">Enchanting</span><br>Sell fish for Fish Points {{Fish}}
|-
| #1fhb || Reimburse || {{Tag|Upgrade|Alpha}}{{Tag|Upgrade|Fish}} || 1 || {{Upgradecost|#1fhb}} || Boost {{Alpha}} based on {{Fish|Fish Pts}}<br><small>Formula: ×log5(fish_pts/10+1)+1.25</small>
|}

