{{EntryDetail|key=ultra|image=Ultra.png|name=Ultra|back=entry-enchants|lore=Fishing luck is increased<br><small>''(Formula: ×(1+0.1*level))''</small><br>but increased reel rotations (reeling time)<br><small>''(Formula: ×(1.1^level))''</small>}}
{{EntryDetail|key=fortune|image=Fortune.png|name=Fortune|back=entry-enchants|lore=Each level gives a +15% chance to catch an extra fish. Any extra percentage carries over to the next roll.}}
{{EntryDetail|key=less-backfire|image=less_backfire.png|name=Less Backfire|back=entry-enchants|lore=Reduce the chance of getting ash when fishing with guns.<br><small>''(Formula: ×1-((level*2)/100)''</small>}}
{{EntryDetail|key=sharpshooter|image=Sharpshooter.png|name=Sharpshooter|back=entry-enchants|lore=Increase fish luck by sharpening your bullets... that might not make sense.<br><small>''(Formula: 1+(0.1*level))''</small>}}

