{{EntryDetail|key=moss|image=Moss.png|name=Moss|rarity=Uncommon|back=items-bait|lore=The moss slowly grows itself...<br><span style="color:#2d96ff;">The bait's amount will not be reduced when it is used. Your base RPS is increased<br>by +round(moss^0.2)/3.</span>}}
{{EntryDetail|key=pizza|image=Pizza.png|name=Pizza|rarity=Rare|back=items-bait|lore=A delicious American treat, with a hint of fish granting a mix of buffs.<br><span style="color:#2d96ff;">×0.9 luck, +2 base RPS, ×1.25 RPS gain</span>}}
{{EntryDetail|key=regen-coil|image=Coil regen.png|name=Regen Coil|rarity=Rare|back=items-bait|lore=Part of the elemental coils, this one helps you resonate with the fish as time elapses.<br><span style="color:#2d96ff;">+0.2/s RPS, slowly weakens to +0/2 at 5 minutes</span>}}
{{EntryDetail|key=speed-coil|image=Coil speed.png|name=Speed Coil|rarity=Rare|back=items-bait|lore=Part of the elemental coils, this one is sure to charge you extraordinarily!<br><span style="color:#2d96ff;">Gives ×2.5 base RPS that diminishes to ×1 after 15 seconds.</span>}}
{{EntryDetail|key=gravity-coil|image=Coil gravity.png|name=Gravity Coil|rarity=Rare|back=items-bait|lore=Part of the elemental coils, this one can stick to fish like glue!<br><span style="color:#2d96ff;">1/3 chance for +1 fish, keeps rolling until you fail or get +5 fish</span>}}
{{EntryDetail|key=fusion-coil|image=Coil fusion.png|name=Fusion Coil|rarity=Epic|back=items-bait|lore=The forbidden mystery of the  elemental coils, combining the strengths of all three!<br><span style="color:#2d96ff;">×2 base RPS, ×2 fish gain, +0.2/s RPS</span>}}

