[[File:CubeTeleporter.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube Telepoter]]
The {{Credits|Cube teleporter|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked by multiple upgrades. It allows the player to teleport to different zones of the game. This baseplates's Cube Teleporter teleport the player to the [[Bonus Baseplate]]



