{{EntryDetail|key=parmesan|image=parmesan_cheese.png|name=Parmesan|rarity=Common|back=items-bait|lore=This type of cheese not everyone will like, but everyone will remember it.<br><span style="color:#2d96ff;">Your fish luck is increased by ×1.5</span>}}
