e theis message ping perishddnt in the upgradex server so he knows he suck |- | Eros || A beating heart in cage, bird in an aquarium. |- | sky123clone1 || Memories are beautiful because they end |- | Signal-Noise || <nowiki>| || || |_</nowiki> |- | Signal-Noise || Crazy? I was crazy once. They locked me in a room; a rubber room; a rubber room with rats. But rats are my friends. |- | Signal-Noise || A picture says no words because it's an image |- | Signal-Noise || Know what can't be known, feel what can't be shown |- | Signal-Noise || I'm zo zorry to hear zat |- | Eros || Is there anything over the walls that trap my body and limit my mind? |- | New EUT players || How would I get Euros? |- | Veemo10 (@PacificInTheSeaWing) || how much wood could a woodchuck chick is a woodchuck could chuck wood |- | Veemo10 (@PacificInTheSeaWing) || what is the real upgradex was the friends we mae along the way |- | Signal-Noise || This is literally 1984 |- | smileyfr || this game is 100 percent [large]FR [normal]certified!!! |- | Signal-Noise || It's not a Baus style Upgrade Tree without mining! |- | YemYemSnowi || also play forsak- actually on second thought probably not.. |- | Signal-Noise || If you think this game having currency humans is weird, ping me |- | Eros || I wonder how much of myself has to change in order to become someone truly new. |- | Signal-Noise || To be or not to be... I dunno I'm indecisive |- | PZxGalaxy || Did I ever tell you 'bout the time my buddy Keith tried to deep-fry a turkey? Third degree burns over 90% of his body. |- | Signal-Noise || Would you mind getting me some soup? What do you mean pleasant? It's just soup. |- | Signal-Noise || A man who always thinks has nothing to think but thoughts |- | allazila || All hail lord Cheesy Micheal |- | Steve Jobs || The only way to do great work is to love what you do. |- | Signal-Noise || Know all there is to know, except for my own mind |- | Signal-Noise || Solar Mass She/They plush coming to a store near you