  border: 3px solid #0b3a1c;
  box-sizing: border-box;

  color: #d9ffe4;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

.mastery-title {
  text-align: center;
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 36px;
  font-weight: bold;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  margin-bottom: 26px;
}

.mastery-title span {
  color: #2cff9a;
  margin: 0 12px;
}

.mastery-line {
  height: 2px;
  background: #0fcf72;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.mastery-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
  align-items: center;

  min-height: 68px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  padding: 0 24px;

  background: #002805;
  border-bottom: 3px solid #061606;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.mastery-num {
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.mastery-text {
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: bold;
  min-width: 0;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.mastery-show {
  display: none;

  background: #10275a;
  border: 2px solid #5aaeff;
  border-radius: 12px;

  color: #ffffff;
  font-weight: bold;

  padding: 8px 14px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.mastery-popup {
  display: none;

  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;

  z-index: 9999;

  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);

  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 18px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.mastery-popup.mastery-popup-open {
  display: flex;
}

.mastery-popup-box {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 420px;

  background: #021006;
  border: 3px solid #0fcf72;
  border-radius: 18px;

  padding: 20px;
  box-sizing: border-box;

  text-align: center;
}

.mastery-popup-title {
  color: #2cff9a;
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.mastery-popup-formula {
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: bold;

  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  word-break: break-word;

  background: #002805;
  border: 2px solid #0b3a1c;
  border-radius: 14px;

  padding: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.mastery-popup-close {
  display: inline-block;

  background: #10275a;
  border: 2px solid #5aaeff;
  border-radius: 12px;

  color: #ffffff;
  font-weight: bold;

  padding: 8px 14px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 900px) {
  .mastery-formula {
    display: none;
  }

  .mastery-show {
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .mastery-text {
    text-align: right;
  }
}

@media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
  .mastery-panel {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 18px;
  }

  .mastery-title {
    font-size: 24px;
  }

  .mastery-row {
    grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
    min-height: 58px;
    padding: 0 12px;
  }

  .mastery-num {
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  .mastery-text {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
}

The RNG Machine is used to roll for [[RNG Machine|Auras]] rewarding {{Yen|Yen}} based on the aura's rarity and is unlocked after purchasing '''#RM''' (Highroll). Auras are also used to purchase '''#[]AU''' upgrades.

== Yen ==

{{Yen|Yen|symbol=no}} ({{Yen}}) is the 5th Bonus currency listed on the statistics tab, it is obtained by activating the [[Nowhere|RNG Machine]] (Unlocked with #RM (Highroll)) and activating the lever on the side. Once the lever is activated, the player will roll an [[Nowhere|Aura]], and get {{Yen|Yen|symbol=no}} depending on the rarity.

