==Arithmetism== Arithmetism is a program that tells you what properties a given natural number has, and gives it a score based on its properties {| class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="text-align: center; width: 50vw;" ! style="width=25%;" | Name ! style="width=75%;" | Definition |- | Palindromic number | A palindromic number that remains the same when its digits are reversed |- | Strobogrammatic number | A strobogrammatic number that remains the same when flipped upside down. |- |ill add more later |trust me |}
==baldi basics v2== baldi basics v2, also known as baldi basics thingy 2 DEMO, is a game where you answer math question with a time limit, decreasing after every answer. You get 3 lives, if you lose them all you lose. There is a combo system that does nothing as of v1.0. ===Easy=== {| class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="text-align: center; width: 50vw;" ! style="width=25%;" | Type of question ! style="width=75%;" | Objective |- | Simple addition | Add 2 numbers together |- | Simple subtraction | Subtract one number from the other |- | Counting problems | Count the number of items on screen |- | Word problems | Answer the problem based on the passage |} ===Medium=== {| class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="text-align: center; width: 50vw;" ! style="width=25%;" | Type of question ! style="width=75%;" | Objective |- | Perfect square | Figure out whether the number given is a square or not |- | Exponent multiplication | Multiply 2 numbers together with the same base |- | Exponent division | Divide one number by the other with the same base |} ===Hard=== {| class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="text-align: center; width: 50vw;" ! style="width=25%;" | Type of question ! style="width=75%;" | Objective |- | Slope of equation | Figure out the slope of the given equation |- | Real solutions | Figure out how many real solutions a gien quadratic has |} [[Category:Features]]

The Computer is a feature that lets players play games and is unlocked after purchasing #3RB (Tinkering)
==Arithmetism== Arithmetism is a program that tells players what properties a given natural number has, and gives it a score based on its properties. Note that if a number has a property that is a combination of 2 other properties, the 2 other properties will not show up. {| class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="text-align: center; width: 50vw;" ! style="width=15%;" | Name ! style="width=65%;" | Definition ! style="width=20%;" | Example |- | Palindromic number | Remains the same when its digits are reversed (also has to be at least 3 digits) | 121 |- | Strobogrammatic number | Remains the same when flipped upside down. | 69 |- | Tetradic number | Is both palindromic and strobogrammatic | 101 |- | Two-faced number | Has no matching digits with its reverse | can't find one |}
==baldi basics v2== baldi basics v2, also known as baldi basics thingy 2 DEMO, is a game where players answer math question with a time limit,starting with 10 seconds and decreasing after every answer. players get 3 lives, if players lose them all players lose. There is a combo system that does nothing as of v1.0. ===Easy=== {| class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="text-align: center; width: 50vw;" ! style="width=25%;" | Type of question ! style="width=75%;" | Objective |- | Simple addition | Add 2 numbers together |- | Simple subtraction | Subtract one number from the other |- | Counting problems | Count the number of items on screen |- | Word problems | Answer the problem based on the passage |} ===Medium=== {| class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="text-align: center; width: 50vw;" ! style="width=25%;" | Type of question ! style="width=75%;" | Objective |- | Perfect square | Figure out whether the number given is a square or not |- | Exponent multiplication | Multiply 2 numbers together with the same base |- | Exponent division | Divide one number by the other with the same base |} ===Hard=== {| class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="text-align: center; width: 50vw;" ! style="width=25%;" | Type of question ! style="width=75%;" | Objective |- | Slope of equation | Figure out the slope of the given equation |- | Real solutions | Figure out how many real solutions a gien quadratic has |} [[Category:Features]]

