the Market is a feature unlocked by purchasing #2fh (Wholesale) for [[Fish|placeholder]] on the [[Fish Island]]. It is used to buy Fishing Rods and Fishing Bait that refresh along with their sales every 15 minutes. additionally, Fishing Rods can also be bought with sales that give a price discount ranging from XX% off to XX% off. 

== History ==
* prior to v1.1, the player was able to buy the '''Pistol''' for a base {{Fish|1000}}
* prior to v1.1, the player was able to buy the '''Momentum Fishing Rod''' for a base {{Fish|500}}

