The <span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#f3caec,#edafcf)">'''Ascension Baseplate'''</span> is the fourth main [[baseplate]] unlocked following the [[Prestige Baseplate|{{Prestige|Prestige Baseplate|symbol=no}}]]. It is unlocked by purchasing #ASC BEYOND on the [[Prestige Baseplate]] for {{Upgradecost|#ASC}}

== Ascension ==
{{Ascension|Ascension|symbol=no}} ({{Ascension}}) is the fifth main currency, unlocked after Prestige by performing an ASCENSION RESET.

[[File:ascension0.png|200px|thumb|center]]

